---
description: "Tech stack and non-negotiables"
alwaysApply: true
---
# Stack
- Frontend: React + TypeScript (strict mode)
- Match/pitch visualization: SVG first; only move to Canvas if profiling
  shows a real frame-rate problem
- Backend: Node.js + Fastify, TypeScript
- Database: PostgreSQL
- LLM: local via Ollama — do not add a cloud LLM API call unless explicitly
  asked to
- Image generation: local, generate once and cache as a static asset —
  never regenerate the same icon/background per session or per request

# Non-negotiables
- No 3D, anywhere (match rendering, stadium editor, anything else). If a
  request implies 3D, say so instead of implementing it.
- No multiplayer or shared-league features.
- No deep financial instruments (loans, debt, external investors, market
  inflation) in v1 — these are explicitly deferred, see PRD Section 4/7.
